window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Miami real estate can be murder.... </p> <p>Working with family is no joke for Jackie Parker. Together with her husband Luke and his brother Logan, Jackie is up against wacky tenants, crazed landlords, and secrets worth killing for.</p> <p>Never mind Jackie's past indiscretion that threatens to destroy the life she has worked so hard to build. And then there is her traitorous heart, a giant dog, a mischievous monkey, and a dead body or two...</p> <p>It's just another day in paradise with Damaged Goods. </p> <p>The Damaged Goods omnibus edition contains four laugh-out-loud mysteries. If you enjoy strong female characters who put it all on the line for family, sassy sleuths, and stories full of heat and heart, you’ll adore Jennifer L. Hart’s unputdownable series. Buy The Damaged Goods omnibus edition and let the fun begin!</p>"; 
